The error message is pretty self-explanatory.  Apparently your design 
matrix has as many columns as there are libraries, so there are no degrees 
of freedom left from which to estimate variability.  According to the code 
and output you have given, this message should be impossible, so you must 
have changed the data in some way that I cannot see.

If you had shown the output from cbind(targets,Group=Group), then I might 
have been able to say something useful.

Best wishes
Gordon

