1. To color the uncertain regions in img2 with let???s say red colour and even have the choice of making it transparent. To then superpose img2 on top of the original image.
2. Maybe the reverse process is better. To make the original figure transparent and superpose it on img2.

I am perhaps asking for too much. But I would appreciate any tip that I can get.
Thanks,
